# Sybil Sweep — project intelligence

## Wedge (never forget)
Enforce on-chain. Graph is evidence. Do not pitch as wallet viz or agent firewall.

## Critical path order
1. Deploy SybilRegistry + Airdrop → reject one hardcoded wallet
2. attestations.json → attestCluster for real clusters
3. Stretch spawn-40 only if #1–2 solid by ~5pm

## Code laws
- Detector: Python stdlib only (no pip) unless team explicitly agrees
- Dashboard: zero CDN / external deps (offline-safe for venue wifi)
- clusterId 0 reserved on-chain → attestations 1-indexed
- Dashboard uses cluster == -1 for honest/unclustered
- evidenceHash is SHA-256 of sorted members+funder+window; contract stores only
- Demo recall should show judgment (~92–96%), not perfect 100%

